                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I tried to leave a comment to this effect, but we need to always re-write the JSON in this path because if we got here it either doesn't exist (line 728) or it is corrupted (line 729)."
                },
                {
                    "file": "log_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 738,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "Do we want to do this if the JSON file existed but was corrupted?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "log_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 738,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't know how much error checking we really need there.  Are we anticipating a lot of file system corruption of that level?  I'm hoping we can add a meson option to leave Cereal in the dust, so trying to figure out which of the two sources is \"better\" seems not that worthwhile."
                },
                {
                    "file": "log_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 738,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "Interesting idea, but yea, probably not necessary I wouldn't think."
                }
            ],
